{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Habiro.CyclotomicEvaluation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Habiro.CyclotomicEvaluation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.RootsOfUnity.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Common.CyclotomicValueTruncates"],"declarations":23,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_at_two_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_at_two_mul","kind":"theorem","line":284,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L284-L288","doc":"Non-vanishing at **every** prime, from one head condition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_at_two_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_at_two_mul","kind":"theorem","line":278,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L278-L282","doc":"The `2p` form used by `def:qou-motivic-galois-instance`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_at_primitiveRoot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_at_primitiveRoot","kind":"theorem","line":271,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L271-L276","doc":"Evaluation at a primitive `2p`-th root truncates at `2p`: the concrete\n`ev_ζ : ℤ[q]^ → ℤ[ζ_{2p}]` well-definedness statement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.head_criterion_vacuous_of_isUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.head_criterion_vacuous_of_isUnit","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L260-L264","doc":"A unit head-divisor makes the criterion unusable — stated so the failure mode\nis a theorem, not a footnote. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_at_sq_eq_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_at_sq_eq_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L239-L258","doc":"**Evaluation at a primitive fourth root is four explicit terms.**\n\n`2` and `4` here are the collapsed Pochhammers `(ζ;ζ)_2 = 2(1-ζ)` and\n`(ζ;ζ)_3 = 4`; `(ζ;ζ)_4 = 0` truncates everything beyond. So at this root\nthe value depends on `a 0 … a 3` alone, however long the series is. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_four_of_sq_eq_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_four_of_sq_eq_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":230,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L230-L237","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_three_of_sq_eq_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_three_of_sq_eq_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L218-L228","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_two_of_sq_eq_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_two_of_sq_eq_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L214-L216","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_three","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L188-L204","doc":"**j = 3 specialisation — what is needed when `j = 2` is silent.**\n\nThe `j = 2` criterion is silent exactly when `p` divides the integer\n`A = a₀(-1) + 2·a₁(-1)` (see `habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_two`).\nMeasured on this corpus, the only odd prime that ever divides `A` is `3`,\nand it does so exactly for the mixed atoms; at `j = 3` the divisor picks up\nthe further factor `1 - ζ³`, and the criterion fires there for every one of\nthem. Silence at one index says nothing about the value — it says the test\nat that index cannot see it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_three","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L183-L186","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_three","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L178-L181","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_two","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L157-L176","doc":"**j = 2 specialisation — the index that is actually usable at `ζ_{2p}`.**\n\n`habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_one` is vacuous at every odd prime,\nbecause `Norm(1 - ζ_n) = Φ_n(1) = 1` unless `n` is a prime power, so\n`1 - ζ_{2p}` is a **unit** there and `head_criterion_vacuous_of_isUnit`\napplies. At `j = 2` the divisor picks up the second factor `1 - ζ² = 1 - ζ_p`,\nwhose norm is `Φ_p(1) = p`; that is a non-unit at every prime, so this form of\nthe criterion has content everywhere.\n\nConcretely, in `ℤ[ζ_{2p}] = ℤ[ζ_p]` with `𝔭 = (1 - ζ_p)` the unique prime above\n`p` and residue field `𝔽_p` (in which `ζ_{2p} ≡ -1`), the hypothesis reduces to\nthe single integer condition `a₀(-1) + 2·a₁(-1) ≢ 0 (mod p)` — one integer per\nseries, deciding non-vanishing at **every** odd prime outside its finite set of\ndivisors, with no dependence on how far the coefficients are known. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_two","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L153-L155","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_two","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L148-L151","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd_one","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L139-L146","doc":"j = 1 specialisation. **Vacuous whenever `1 - ζ` is a unit** — in particular\nat every primitive `2p`-th root for odd prime `p`, where `Φ_{2p}(1) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_one","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L136-L137","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L127-L134","doc":"**Non-vanishing criterion (j-term head).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_sub_head","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_sub_head","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L116-L125","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_stable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_stable","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L102-L114","doc":"**Well-definedness.** Past the order of `ζ`, truncating further changes nothing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_add","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L96-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.habiroEval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.habiroEval","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L93-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_dvd_of_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_dvd_of_le","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L86-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_eq_zero_of_pow_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Habiro.qPochDiag_eq_zero_of_pow_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Habiro/CyclotomicEvaluation.lean#L78-L84","signatureChunk":0}]}